{'symbol': 'HUM', 'date': '2023-02-16 06:30:00', 'title': 'HUMANA BOARD DECLARES PAYMENT OF QUARTERLY DIVIDEND TO STOCKHOLDERS; INCREASES PER SHARE DIVIDEND BY 12.4 PERCENT', 'text': 'LOUISVILLE, KY.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HUMANA INC. (NYSE: HUM) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A CASH DIVIDEND TO STOCKHOLDERS OF $0.885 PER SHARE PAYABLE ON APRIL 28, 2023 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MARCH 31, 2023. THE DIVIDEND OF $0.885 PER SHARE REFLECTS AN INCREASE OF 12.4 PERCENT FROM THE PREVIOUS PER SHARE DIVIDEND OF $0.7875. ABOUT HUMANA HUMANA INC.'}